# Keep build output and local cruft out of the build context. Without this, `COPY . .`
# ships your bin/obj into the image, invalidates the layer cache on every local build,
# and risks copying secrets from .env files.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/node_modules/
**/*.user
**/appsettings.*.Local.json
**/.env
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
README.md
